  "bodyHash": "0d61eb993eb33890",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>TideMaid</h1>\n<p>一款兼容 <strong>Tide</strong> 与 <strong>Touhou Little Maid</strong> 的模组，允许女仆从 Tide 模组中捕捉特殊鱼类。</p>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f08e54a9d4412a72d36a2e9eacf265bc3158d553.jpeg\" alt=\"TideMaid 功能展示\">\n<h2>功能特性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Tide 钓鱼任务</strong>：为女仆新增钓鱼任务，使其能够使用钓竿捕捉 Tide 模组的特殊鱼类。</li>\n<li><strong>自动钓鱼</strong>：女仆会自动寻找水域并捕捞 Tide 资源。</li>\n</ul>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/133c243195b74c3f9ae45fe0de56f1cb3d323812.png\" alt=\"女仆钓鱼任务界面\">\n<h2>使用方法</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>给女仆一把钓竿</li>\n<li>为该女仆分配“Tide 钓鱼”任务</li>\n<li>女仆将自动寻找附近的水源并开始垂钓 Tide 鱼类。</li>\n</ol>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1909076bdf22577ef13aabc45a44a67daac1bd9c.jpeg\" alt=\"女仆自动钓鱼流程\">\n<h2>依赖要求</h2>\n<p>安装本模组需要预先安装以下前置模组：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftouhou-little-maid\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Touhou Little Maid</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tide</a></li>\n<li>NeoForge</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>支持与反馈</h2>\n<p>如果遇到任何问题或有建议，请前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/CHA1007/TideMaid/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub Issues</a> 页面进行反馈。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
